					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							Hey all. Myself and Shidosan will be oficially getting married Sat March 17 at 2PM PST outside the temple of marr in freeport. Shidosan has sincerely requested your presence at the wedding and would like very much for the friends and family he grew up with to be there for our special day. If you can't make it, we understand, but we really hope you all can share this moment with us. Hope to see you there.<br />
